# Hilltop Transmission Main — Transient (Surge) Analysis, 2019

**Prepared for:** {{ ww_org_name }} — Cedar Ridge Regional Transmission System
**Prepared by:** Hydra Controls Integration LLC (hydraulics) w/ M. Oyelaran, PE review
**Subject:** Water-hammer protection of the Hilltop PS-3 → Summit Tank 16" main
**Status:** Issued for construction (control settings implemented in RTU03)

